type: software
title: "The Dark Unification"
abstract: >
  A unified framework connecting three aspects of a single dark sector:
  (1) Self-Interacting Dark Matter via a Secluded Majorana Scalar Mediator,
  with velocity-dependent cross sections computed via the Variable Phase Method;
  (2) Path-integral foundations showing that VPM is exactly the fluctuation
  determinant of the generating functional, and that H0=67.4 km/s/Mpc emerges
  from dark QCD misalignment; (3) Dark Electromagnetic Duality, proposing that
  dark energy is the T-breaking (pseudoscalar) component of the same Yukawa
  interaction, with a universal relic angle theta_relic=18.43 deg fixed by
  A4 group theory.
